{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36637","headline":"寄前户部陆郎中 · 罗隐","name":"寄前户部陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出驯桑雉入朝簪，萧洒清名映士林。\n近日篇章欺白雪，早年词赋得黄金。\n桂堂纵道探龙颔，兰省何曾驻鹤心。\n离乱事多人不会，酒浓花暖且闲吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}